	'ab_b1' => 'We chose from the beginning not to offer hourly or pay-and-display parking. Hourly parking brings traffic queues, crowded entry ramps, idling engines, and constant uncertainty for people who work in town. By offering dedicated monthly bays, every space remains reserved for one driver. You never have to search for an empty bay before work or worry about returning after dusk. Our car parks stay calm, quiet, and predictable. Our team can concentrate on keeping each location clean and orderly rather than dealing with ticket machines and transient turnover.',
	'ab_b2' => 'Maintaining our six locations requires daily attention on foot. Mara Lindqvist and Tomás Reyes visit our car parks regularly to inspect surface drainage, check barrier mechanisms, and confirm that all lighting is in good order. We do not rely on automated sensors or distant contractors. Clean tarmac, crisp painted bay markings, and clear sightlines help drivers feel comfortable at any hour. When maintenance or resurfacing is necessary, we plan the work carefully so regular parking routines continue without disruption. Every car park remains open 24 hours daily with steady care throughout the year.',
	'ab_b3' => 'Our team of six keeps operations dependable across Northgate. Mara Lindqvist is our founder and leads personal site walks with prospective drivers. Tomás Reyes oversees daily operations, physical maintenance, and barrier equipment. Aiko Brandt prepares contracts, explains terms, and manages bay allocations. Samuel Okafor serves as night attendant at Canal Street, providing an attentive presence. Lena Fischer manages accounts, monthly invoices, and key fob deposits. Priya Nair handles customer communications, reviewing applications and replying to every enquiry within 2 working days.',
