	'about_h2' => 'A bay that is simply yours',
	'about_p1' => 'Founded in 2009 at 18 Canal Street, Teisha Parking was established to give town drivers an unhurried, dependable alternative to the daily search for a space. Rather than competing for pay-and-display spots or circling crowded streets, our drivers hold a dedicated monthly bay in one of six established car parks in Northgate.',
	'about_p2' => 'We believe a parking agreement should be calm, personal and completely transparent. Mara Lindqvist and the team walk every site with you before any contract is signed, spending twenty minutes on sightlines, vehicle clearances, evening lighting and barrier access, so you know the car fits comfortably.',
	'about_p3' => 'There are no hidden administrative charges and no complicated lock-in clauses. Every bay is open twenty-four hours a day, looked after by attentive on-site staff, with simple thirty-day notice and a reply to every request within two working days.',
	'apply_h2' => 'Ask for a bay',
