	'co_b1' => 'To request an allocated parking bay, submit our single enquiry form. We ask for your full name, email address, chosen car park site, vehicle make and model, and target start month. You can choose to begin on either the 1st or the 15th of the month. Priya Nair will review our current bay ledger and send a personal reply within 2 working days to propose an available bay and arrange your site visit.',
