	'ct_b1' => 'The agreement outlines site services and driver obligations across 8 clear items. Included in your fee: an allocated monthly parking bay; access through electronic barriers 24 hours daily; routine tarmac sweeping and surface upkeep; working floodlights; seasonal leaf and snow clearance; and regular site inspections. Not covered: private insurance for your vehicle or personal property, and external storage of loose items or goods on the bay surface. Drivers must hold valid road insurance for their vehicle throughout the contract term.',
	'ct_b2' => 'Agreements operate on a rolling monthly basis beginning on either the 1st or the 15th of the month. We do not require long annual lock-ins. If your circumstances change, you can end your agreement by providing 30 days notice to Aiko Brandt. You can send notice by email, and our office confirms receipt within 2 working days. If you change your car during your contract, simply contact us with your updated vehicle details so our attendant records remain current.',
	'ct_b3' => 'Each driver receives an electronic key fob that opens the barrier gates at their designated site. We ask for a €30 one-off deposit for the fob when the contract is signed. Lena Fischer handles deposit records and returns the €30 deposit when the undamaged fob is handed back to our 18 Canal Street office after your contract ends. If a key fob is damaged or lost, our office can issue a replacement fob upon payment of a €30 replacement fee.',
