	'fq3_q' => 'How much is the deposit for the key fob?',
	'fq4_a' => 'No. Your allocated bay is dedicated exclusively to your registered vehicle 24 hours daily. Because Teisha Parking provides monthly bays only and does not run hourly pay-and-display parking, transient drivers do not enter our bays. If an unauthorized vehicle is parked in your bay, contact our office or Samuel Okafor at Canal Street and our operations team will attend to it.',
	'fq4_q' => 'Can someone else park in my allocated bay?',
