	'fq5_q' => 'How much notice must I give to cancel my bay?',
	'fq6_a' => 'If your preferred car park has no vacancies, Priya Nair will contact you within 2 working days. You can choose to join our waitlist for that location or select an open bay at another Teisha Parking site. As soon as an existing driver submits 30 days notice to leave, we contact the next person on the waitlist in order of inquiry.',
	'fq6_q' => 'What happens if my preferred car park is full?',
	'fq7_a' => 'Yes. All six of our town car parks remain open and accessible 24 hours daily. Your electronic barrier key fob operates the vehicle barrier at any time of day or night. While our office at 18 Canal Street operates during posted business hours, barrier gates and lighting across all six sites remain operational 24 hours daily.',
	'fq7_q' => 'Are the car parks accessible 24 hours daily?',
