	'si1_p' => 'Located at 18 Canal Street in central Northgate, this car park provides 64 dedicated monthly bays across open-air and covered sections. The site has an overhead height clearance bar at the entrance and open clearance on outdoor bays. Access is available 24 hours daily, with Samuel Okafor on site during evening hours. The location is suited for town-centre office staff, canal retail employees, and residents living nearby. The nearest public transport connection is the Canal Street bus stop just along the pavement.',
