	'si3_n' => 'Northgate Station',
	'si3_p' => 'Located at Station Approach, Northgate Station is our largest car park with 96 monthly bays across covered and open-air areas. The covered bays have an entrance clearance bar suitable for standard family cars. The car park remains open 24 hours daily with steady lighting across every row. This site is suited for railway commuters, hospital shift workers, and evening travellers who need an allocated bay beside the transport hub. The nearest public transport connection is Northgate railway station.',
	'si4_n' => 'Orchard Yard',
	'si4_p' => 'Set within Orchard Lane, Orchard Yard offers 42 monthly bays in an enclosed courtyard setting surrounded by trees. The site has an open overhead entrance that accommodates family cars and estate vehicles easily. Barrier access is available 24 hours daily with an electronic key fob. This quiet car park is suited for neighbourhood residents, clinic workers, and local professionals who prefer parking away from busy thoroughfares. The nearest public transport connection is the Orchard Yard tram stop.',
	'si5_n' => 'Riverside Depot',
	'si5_p' => 'Located along Depot Wharf on the riverfront, Riverside Depot provides 74 monthly bays on a wide tarmac apron. The entrance clearance accommodates commercial delivery vans and high-roof trade vehicles. Access is open 24 hours daily, offering wide turning room for loading and staging. This site is suited for small trade fleets, local delivery drivers, and commercial businesses requiring dependable vehicle parking near the river. The nearest public transport connection is the Riverside Depot bus stop and ferry pier.',
	'si6_n' => 'Library Square',
	'si6_p' => 'Situated beside the civic plaza at Library Square, this site provides 48 monthly bays, including spaces equipped with electric vehicle charging points. An entrance height barrier accommodates passenger vehicles. Access is available 24 hours daily under calm architectural lighting. This location is suited for civic workers, town visitors, and electric vehicle drivers who want dedicated charging while parked. The nearest public transport connection is the Library Square tram stop positioned right beside the entrance gate.',
